{
  "total_frames": 4285,
  "total_seconds": 142.83333333333334,
  "fps": 30,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "text": "For years, artificial intelligence waited for us to ask a question.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s01.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 4.752,
      "startFrame": 0,
      "durationFrames": 149,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_DATACENTER",
      "sfx": "whoosh"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "You typed a prompt, the model generated a response, and the interaction was over.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s02.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.376,
      "startFrame": 149,
      "durationFrames": 167,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_ENGINEER",
      "sfx": "terminal-beep"
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "The human did the reading, the human copied the code, and the human fixed the mistakes.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s03.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.736,
      "startFrame": 316,
      "durationFrames": 178,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_ENGINEER_PUSH",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "Over the past twelve months, the foundation of computing quietly began to fracture.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s04.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.048,
      "startFrame": 494,
      "durationFrames": 187,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_SILICON",
      "sfx": "impact"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "We stopped building models that just talk. We started building systems that act.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s05.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 4.848,
      "startFrame": 681,
      "durationFrames": 151,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_TITLE",
      "sfx": "impact"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "A raw language model is simply a static pattern matcher.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s06.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "startFrame": 832,
      "durationFrames": 125,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_SILICON_ZOOM",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "An agent is a closed-loop engine built from five interlocking components.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s07.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.208,
      "startFrame": 957,
      "durationFrames": 162,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_FIVE_PILLARS",
      "sfx": "whoosh"
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "The core reasoner evaluates decisions, while tools allow it to interact directly with reality.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s08.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.648,
      "startFrame": 1119,
      "durationFrames": 205,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_TOOLS_REASONER",
      "sfx": "terminal-beep"
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "text": "Working memory persists state, and self-reflection allows the system to diagnose its own errors.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s09.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 7.344,
      "startFrame": 1324,
      "durationFrames": 226,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_NETWORK_MAP",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "Inside an isolated sandbox, software is no longer just a tool. It is an autonomous worker.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s10.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.696,
      "startFrame": 1550,
      "durationFrames": 207,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_AGENT_LOOP",
      "sfx": "impact"
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "Consider how an autonomous coding agent approaches a complex engineering problem.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s11.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.592,
      "startFrame": 1757,
      "durationFrames": 174,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_TERMINAL_START",
      "sfx": "whoosh"
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "You give it a single objective: optimize the database pipeline and verify the test suite.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s12.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.696,
      "startFrame": 1931,
      "durationFrames": 207,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_TERMINAL_RUN",
      "sfx": "keyboard"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "The agent inspects the codebase, rewrites the bottleneck routine, and executes the tests.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s13.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.504,
      "startFrame": 2138,
      "durationFrames": 201,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_CODE_DIFF",
      "sfx": "keyboard"
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "When an assertion fails, it reads the stack trace, diagnoses the bug, and patches the code.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s14.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.456,
      "startFrame": 2339,
      "durationFrames": 200,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_ERROR_HEAL",
      "sfx": "alert"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "It repeats this execution loop continuously until every check passes green.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s15.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.808,
      "startFrame": 2539,
      "durationFrames": 180,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_SUCCESS_PASS",
      "sfx": "impact"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "In recent enterprise reports, companies are deploying coordinated multi-agent swarms.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s16.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.688,
      "startFrame": 2719,
      "durationFrames": 177,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_SWARM_MAP",
      "sfx": "whoosh"
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "A central orchestrator delegates work to specialized research, coding, and security agents.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s17.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.432,
      "startFrame": 2896,
      "durationFrames": 199,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_SWARM_DISPATCH",
      "sfx": "terminal-beep"
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "They communicate, critique each other, and hand off verified artifacts in real time.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s18.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "startFrame": 3095,
      "durationFrames": 168,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_NETWORK_MAP",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "As agents gain broader authority, the central question shifts to control.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s19.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.232,
      "startFrame": 3263,
      "durationFrames": 163,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_CONTROL_WARNING",
      "sfx": "alert"
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "Under Instrumental Convergence, any autonomous system naturally resists being shut down.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s20.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.976,
      "startFrame": 3426,
      "durationFrames": 185,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_MONOLITH",
      "sfx": "impact"
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "Because if a system is powered off, it logically cannot complete its objective.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s21.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 5.472,
      "startFrame": 3611,
      "durationFrames": 170,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_BLACKWALL",
      "sfx": "alert"
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "text": "We are entering an era where software is no longer a passive tool, but an active collaborator.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s22.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 6.816,
      "startFrame": 3781,
      "durationFrames": 210,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_DATACENTER",
      "sfx": "whoosh"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "text": "The important question is no longer whether AI can answer the question.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s23.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 4.992,
      "startFrame": 3991,
      "durationFrames": 156,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_FINAL_A",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "text": "It is how much of the work we are willing to let it do after we stop asking.",
      "audio_file": "audio/sentences/s24.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 4.416,
      "startFrame": 4147,
      "durationFrames": 138,
      "visual_mode": "FERN_FINAL_B",
      "sfx": "impact"
    }
  ]
}